Hooray, Don’t Bleed is live.  Okay, back to reality, we are deep in development even with the release today (or yesterday whenever you read this), be happy to know animations yes, animations will be getting an overhaul both FPS & TPS perspectives.   More art content will be dropped into the game as well on the update coming next month.  Take a look at the Art Page to see some of what I’m mentioning to you.  We’ve been listening to those testers who have provided feedback.

We want to give a major [b]SHOUT OUT TO[/b]:

@Sckiz1 
@OGZxFTW 
@copco1

Thank you for the feedback, it has definitely helped and we will be showing you our appreciation soon, so stay tuned...

